  "body": "Found by the QA swarm round 2 (#2582), brief q01 (the round-1 plate again), CamCraft **v0.25.0** Linux x86_64 release, which carries the fix for #3020 (PR #3054). Reproduced by hand.\n\n## What happens\n\nPlate 120 x 80 x 12 (top Z 12, stock top Z 13, faced to the model top), a Ø16 island with an M6 tap-drill hole Ø5 at (0, 0), four Ø6.6 holes. Drill op \"Spot_All_5\", tool SPOT-0800-90 (custom: kind drill, Ø8, tip 90°), every hole `entry_z 12, floor_z 10` (2 mm deep), `top_z` top of model:\n\n```\nverify -> \"ok\": false, \"held_by\": [\"Spot_All_5\"],\n  {\"blocks_post\": true, \"kind\": \"gouge\", \"message\": \"move 11 cuts past the finish surface\", \"move\": 11, \"op\": \"Spot_All_5\"}\n```\n\nMove 11 is the spot on the Ø5 hole. A 90° cone 2 mm deep is Ø4 at Z 12, inside the Ø5 hole (radius 2.5 > 2.0), and nothing of the part is above Z 12. `render_stock` reports `gouge: cells 0, max 0.0`. The four Ø6.6 holes with the same spot pass. The agent found that `floor_z 10.5` (cone Ø3 at Z 12) passes; the cone reaches radius 2.5 at Z 13, the stock top, which suggests the law reads the cone up to the stock top instead of the part top.\n\n## Expected\n\nA spot whose cone stays inside the hole at the part top passes verify and posts, as #3020 now does for its case.\n\n## Repro files\n\n[repro-spot-center-gouge.camproj](https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/blob/qa-artifacts/qa/round2-20261122/q01-2d-plate/repro-spot-center-gouge.camproj) (`open_project`, `generate`, `verify`), [repro-spot-gouge.camproj](https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/blob/qa-artifacts/qa/round2-20261122/q01-2d-plate/repro-spot-gouge.camproj), [q01-2d-plate.step](https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/blob/qa-artifacts/qa/round2-20261122/q01-2d-plate/q01-2d-plate.step); agent report [REPORT.md](https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/blob/qa-artifacts/qa/round2-20261122/q01-2d-plate/REPORT.md) problem 2.\n\nDone means: repro-spot-center-gouge.camproj verifies with no gouge finding and posts (pinned by a test next to #3020's), and a spot that truly cuts the hole wall at the part top is still refused.\n",
